<title>PHILIPPINES: Vitarich 9-mth net loss 571.225 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Vitarich 9-mth net loss 571.225 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Animal feed producer and poultry breeder Vitarich Corp said on Monday its net loss in the first three quarters of 1996 amounted to 571.225 million pesos due to a glut in the poultry industry.</p>
</text>
